---
import { tracks } from "../../data/cake2025.json";
---

<section class="section background">
  <div class="section__inner container">
    <h2>Thematic tracks</h2>
    <p>
      The inaugural CAKE conf, hosted by Jagiellonian University in Kraków,
      Poland, took place on September 19–20 2025. Around 100 attendees
      celebrated all things content: from UX writing, documentation, and
      storytelling to accessibility and team management. Our audience got
      inspired through diverse talks, hands-on workshops, and a unique ambient
      journaling session designed to reflect on the topics presented during the
      day.
    </p>
    <p>
      From UX writing to AI, from documentation to storytelling, from
      accessibility to managing content teams. We bring together content
      enthusiasts from different backgrounds to share insights, spark ideas, and
      build a more connected content ecosystem.
    </p>
    <p>
      CAKE conf has it all. Thanks to broad topic
      areas, we can offer you the best content experience.
    </p>
    <div>
      {
        tracks.map((track) => (
          <div class="tracks">
            <h3>{track.track}</h3>
            <p>{track.description}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .background {
    background-color: #ececec;
    color: #000000;
  }

  .container {
    padding-top: 100px;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
  }

  .tracks {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 30px;
    padding-top: 30px;
  }

  h3 {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 32px;
  }

  @media only screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .tracks {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
